<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kn">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ಸಿಬಿಎಸ್‌ಇ ಸಿಲಬಸ್ ಟ್ರ್ಯಾಕರ್</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f4f6f9;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-primary: #1f2937;
            --text-secondary: #6b7280;
            --accent-color: #4f46e5;
            --accent-hover: #4338ca;
            --border-color: #e5e7eb;
            --success-color: #10b981;
            --danger-color: #ef4444;
            --badge-bg: #eef2ff;
            --date-badge-bg: #f3f4f6;
            --hover-bg: #f9fafb;
            --radius: 12px;
            --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        body.dark-mode {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #334155;
            --badge-bg: #312e81;
            --date-badge-bg: #334155;
            --hover-bg: #334155;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        header p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .theme-toggle {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .overall-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .overall-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .progress-bar-bg {
            background-color: var(--border-color);
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .progress-bar-fill {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            height: 100%;
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tabs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            white-space: nowrap;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: var(--accent-color);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }

        .subject-overview {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .add-chapter-box {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .add-chapter-box h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .form-row input, .form-row button {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background: var(--card-bg);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .form-row input {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 140px;
        }

        .form-row button {
            background: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .form-row button:hover {
            background: var(--accent-hover);
        }

        .chapter-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .chapter-item {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .chapter-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--hover-bg);
        }

        .chapter-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .chapter-item input[type="checkbox"] {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            accent-color: var(--accent-color);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .chapter-title {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .chapter-item.completed .chapter-title {
            text-decoration: line-through;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .meta-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .book-badge {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            background: var(--badge-bg);
            color: var(--accent-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        body.dark-mode .book-badge {
            color: #818cf8;
        }

        .date-badge {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            background: var(--date-badge-bg);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .delete-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--danger-color);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            padding: 0 4px;
        }

        .reset-btn {
            display: block;
            margin: 24px auto 0;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--danger-color);
            color: var(--danger-color);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .reset-btn:hover {
            background: var(--danger-color);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                padding-top: 40px;
            }
            .theme-toggle {
                top: 0;
                right: 50%;
                transform: translateX(50%);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()">
            <span id="theme-icon">🌙</span> <span id="theme-text">ಡಾರ್ಕ್ ಮೋಡ್</span>
        </button>
        <h1>ಸಿಬಿಎಸ್‌ಇ ಸಿಲಬಸ್ ಟ್ರ್ಯಾಕರ್</h1>
        <p>ನಿಮ್ಮ ವಿಷಯಗಳ ತಯಾರಿ ಮತ್ತು ಗುರಿ ದಿನಾಂಕಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸಿ</p>
    </header>

    <div class="overall-card">
        <div class="overall-header">
            <h2>ಒಟ್ಟು ಬೋರ್ಡ್ ತಯಾರಿ</h2>
            <span id="overall-percentage" style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-color);">0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-bar-bg">
            <div id="overall-progress-bar" class="progress-bar-fill"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs" id="tabs-container"></div>
    <div id="contents-container"></div>

    <button class="reset-btn" onclick="resetProgress()">ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಪ್ರಗತಿಯನ್ನು ಮರುಹೊಂದಿಸಿ (Reset)</button>

    <script>
        const defaultData = [
            {
